| **Failure-Mode & Edge-Case Coverage** | 25% | Explicit handling of degenerate regimes (e.g., singular $\Sigma_B$, `severe_penetration` vs `invalid` physics, short macro truncation $k < K$, RNN prefix burn-in). |

